 1340  07FE: 57 52 49 54 45 20 59 4F 55 52 20 54 45 58 54 20 49 4E 54 4F 20 42 30 30 30 68 2E 2E 42 37 43 46 68 20 2D 20 54 48 49 53 20 57 49 4E 44 4F 57 20 49 53 20 54 48 45 20 50 43 20 53 43 52 45 45 4E 00 S_T4:   DB 'WRITE YOUR TEXT INTO B000h..B7CFh - THIS WINDOW IS THE PC SCREEN',0
 1341  083F: 53 45 51 3A 5F 5F 20 46 52 41 4D 45 20 7E 33 37 20 4D 53 20 42 41 43 4B 2D 54 4F 2D 42 41 43 4B 20 7C 20 52 45 47 45 4E 2B 53 43 41 4E 20 49 4E 20 49 53 52 20 2D 20 54 4D 49 41 52 4D 20 50 41 43 45 44 00 S_T5:   DB 'SEQ:__ FRAME ~37 MS BACK-TO-BACK | REGEN+SCAN IN ISR - TMIARM PACED',0
